Z||000006||william_thorniii||03-08-2001||07:58 PM||||Friends,<P>The date is the last weekend in April (27-29th).  Last year most folks stayed on University Drive very near the Motel 6.  If I remember correctly the majority of folks stayed at one of the Holiday Inns on University.<P>Does anyone know the name of the $25 motel there near University?  Judging from the map, (www.huntsville.org/Pages/Hotels.html) I would guess that it was perhaps on 231/431.<P>There are two groups that I am aware of heading down from Indiana and Ohio.  One group is leaving Friday a.m. and the other is leaving Friday around 7 p.m.  attendees will be as follows: fiero56, fiero87ec05, boilermaker, chadman and myself.   <P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||1
