Z||000009||Bob Englert||03-08-2001||11:06 PM||||I plan to be there. <P>I normally stay at a La Quinta Inn on University (there are 2 of them).  The west La Quinta is right across from the Mall, the east one is near Jordan Lane and across the street from the Motel 6 that many stayed at last year.  The east La Quinta is also very near Ed and Rosey's favorite Mexican restaurant.<P>Both are easy to get to the shop from.  A little above budget rates, but nice rooms.<P>------------------<BR>Bob<BR>2 - 87 GT's<BR>85 SE 4 cyl||||reg||1
